20498: Section 12 Timer Unit (TMU)
20499: 
20500: 12.2.2 Timer Start Register (TSTR)
20501: 
20502: TSTR is an 8-bit readable/writable register that specifies whether the channel 0-2 timer counters
20503: (TCNT) are operated or stopped.
20504: 
20505: TSTR is initialized to H'00 by a power-on or manual reset, or standby mode. In module standby
20506: mode, TSTR is not initialized when the input clock selected by each channel is the on-chip RTC
20507: output clock (RTCCLK), and is initialized only when the input clock is the external clock (TCLK)
20508: or internal clock (Pck).
20509: 
